    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can. Any cards in your trash that are black and/or purple Digimon cards with play costs of 8 or less can be returned to your hand.",
        "question": "This [When Digivolving] effect returns up to 2 black and/or purple Digimon cards with play costs of 8 or less from my trash. Can I return cards that weren't trashed using this card's effect?",
