      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, a Digimon card with a play cost of 8 or less can be played with a black or purple Digimon card that was originally in the trash.",
        "question": "Can this card's [When Digivolving] effect play 2 black or purple Digimon cards of play cost 8 or less in my trash without paying the cost, even if they are not the cards I discarded with this effect?",
